      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Logs page is a reasonable place to list /redfish/v1/TaskService/Tasks, and the route, role gate, and pagination match the rest of this tree. On current bmcweb the Cancel button fails for the tasks the commit is about, and the 5-second poll hides the progress it is meant to show. The fields used to explain a task — TaskState, TaskStatus, and Messages — are fetched and then dropped.",
