      "message": "Now uses the shared fetchCollection() with { expand: true } and\nsupportsExpandQuery(serviceRoot), gated on ServiceRoot. Dropped fetchTasks,\nthe \"already expanded\" heuristic, useTaskService() and the @/store/api import.\nI exported fetchCollection to reuse it with polling - can add query-option\npassthrough to useRedfishCollection instead if you prefer.\n\n@/api/client and membersAreExpanded() don\u0027t exist on master as of this rebase;\neverything in the tree imports @/store/api. Which commit adds them?",
