      "message": "Added a State column (TaskState + outcome icon) and a Message column\n(message + Resolution). Removed the invalid :title on StatusIcon. Renamed the\nfirst column to \"Name\" since bmcweb puts \"Task {id}\" there.\n\nTwo deviations: I use the last Messages[] entry, not the first - startTimer()\nappends TaskStarted at index 0, so the first always reads \"has started\".\nAnd Exception maps to danger, since bmcweb reports it with TaskStatus Warning.\n\nPercentComplete left as bmcweb reports it (0 even when finished) - happy to\nrender \"--\" instead. SSE banner as a follow-up, keeping this as the inventory.",
