      "writtenOn": "2026-10-05T13:28:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Removed rather than commented out - history keeps it for when bmcweb lands the\nmonitor DELETE. Confirmed in task.hpp that both task routes register\nverb::get only, and TaskMonitor stays set until gave204.\n\nImplemented the outcome rule but adapted it: percentComplete is initialised to\n0 and never set to 100 for dump or update tasks, so applied verbatim it marked\nevery success as failed. Percent now only contradicts a Completed/OK task that\nreported real progress. Failure text comes from the last message + Resolution.\n\nPinia store I\u0027d rather do alongside the SSE/banner work.",
      "parentUuid": "72539a0a_26839529",
      "revId": "d7c2e36cdbc9a7136312b086b4c6201a5abc6dfc",
